abstract: >-
  Code and documentation for a four-wave latent transition analysis of unmet
  healthcare needs among Korean adults, 2020-2023, using the second-phase Korea
  Health Panel. The package builds the analysis panel from the restricted KHP
  SPSS files, fits the latent transition model by weighted EM with bootstrap
  inference, estimates three-step covariate models, and writes every table,
  figure and quoted number reported in the manuscript.
